  "title": "Grocery Outlet Holding Corp. Announces Second Quarter Fiscal 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call Date",
  "summary": "EMERYVILLE, Calif., July 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Grocery Outlet Holding Corp. (NASDAQ: GO) (“Grocery Outlet” or the “Company”) today announced that its financial results for the second quarter of fiscal 2026 will be released after the market close on Wednesday, August 12, 2026.",
